# Every text file here is LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Skills ship runnable code -- 222 .sh, 412 .py, 206 .R, plus workflow files -- that users execute
# on Linux, in WSL and in containers. With no attributes, a Windows checkout under
# core.autocrlf=true rewrote all of them to CRLF and every shell script then failed with
# "$'\r': command not found", including the smoke test a Skill tells users to run to confirm their
# install. Found by the bio-causal-genomics-heritability-partitioning re-audit, 2026-09-17.
#
# Every blob in this repository was already LF when this file was added, so it changes no content:
# it stops the checkout from corrupting what is committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Detected as binary on content today; declared so it stays that way.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
